#: ../../../changelog.rst:1350
msgid ""
"Upgrade instructions: When upgrading to 0.15.0.0 or above from a "
"pre-0.15.0.0 version, you must re-install all packages to take advantage of "
"the new persistent pipx metadata files introduced in this release. These "
"metadata files store pip specification values, injected packages, any custom "
"pip arguments, and more in each main package's venv. You can do this by "
"running ``pipx reinstall-all`` or ``pipx uninstall-all``, then reinstalling "
"manually."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../changelog.rst:1355
msgid ""
"``install`` now has no ``--spec`` option. You may specify any valid pip "
"specification for ``install``'s main argument."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../changelog.rst:1356
msgid "``inject`` will now accept pip specifications for dependency arguments"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../changelog.rst:1357
msgid ""
"Metadata is now stored for each application installed, including install "
"options like ``--spec``, and injected packages. This information allows "
"upgrade, upgrade-all and reinstall-all to work properly even with non-pypi "
"installed packages. (#222)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../changelog.rst:1360
msgid ""
"``upgrade`` options ``--spec`` and ``--include-deps`` were removed. Pipx now "
"uses the original options used to install each application instead. (#222)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../changelog.rst:1362
msgid ""
"``upgrade-all`` options ``--include-deps``, ``--system-site-packages``, ``--"
"index-url``, ``--editable``, and ``--pip-args`` were removed. Pipx now uses "
"the original options used to install each application instead. (#222)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../changelog.rst:1364
msgid ""
"``reinstall-all`` options ``--include-deps``, ``--system-site-packages``, "
"``--index-url``, ``--editable``, and ``--pip-args`` were removed. Pipx now "
"uses the original options used to install each application instead. (#222)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../changelog.rst:1366
msgid "Handle missing interpreters more gracefully (#146)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../changelog.rst:1367
msgid ""
"Change ``reinstall-all`` to use system python by default for apps. Now use "
"``--python`` option to specify a different python version."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../changelog.rst:1369
msgid ""
"Remove the PYTHONPATH environment variable when executing any command to "
"prevent conflicts between pipx dependencies and package dependencies when "
"pipx is installed via homebrew. Homebrew can use PYTHONPATH manipulation "
"instead of virtual environments. (#233)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../changelog.rst:1372
msgid "Add printed summary after successful call to ``pipx inject``"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../changelog.rst:1373
msgid "Support associating apps with Python 3.5"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../changelog.rst:1374
msgid "Improvements to animation status text"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../changelog.rst:1375
msgid "Make ``--python`` argument in ``reinstall-all`` command optional"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../changelog.rst:1376
msgid "Use threads on OS's without support for semaphores"
